Pre-Registration Reward — Terms

Sudoku Academy (the "App"), published by SamsiPlay, an individual developer — Last updated: August 18, 2026

These terms describe the one-time reward offered to players who pre-registered for the App on Google Play before its public launch (the "Pre-Registration Reward"). They apply in addition to, not instead of, the Google Play Terms of Service and our own Privacy Policy governing use of the App.

1. What the reward is

Players who pre-registered for the App on Google Play before launch, and who open the App after it becomes available, will automatically receive:

1 Streak Freeze Token — a one-time, in-app item that can be used to restore a single missed day of the Daily Challenge streak.
The "Founder" cosmetic board skin — a decorative, non-functional visual style for the game board (custom digit font, border, and corner decoration). It changes only the board's appearance and has no effect on gameplay, difficulty, or scoring.

Together, these are referred to as the "Reward."

2. Eligibility

To receive the Reward, you must have:

Tapped "Pre-register" for the App on its Google Play Store listing before the App's official launch date, using the same Google account you use to play the App; and
Opened the App at least once after launch, while signed in to that same Google account and with an active internet connection (so the App can confirm the pre-registration with Google Play).

The Reward is granted automatically. No code, purchase, or additional action is required beyond the steps above. There is nothing to redeem manually.

3. Delivery and technical requirements

The Reward is delivered through Google Play's own pre-registration reward system. Whether and when it is granted is determined by Google Play, not by us; we only detect and unlock it in the App once Google Play confirms it. Delivery may be delayed by factors outside our control, including but not limited to network connectivity, Google Play service availability, or the timing of your first launch after release.

4. Limitations
The Reward is limited to one per Google account / per device. It cannot be earned more than once, transferred, gifted, sold, or exchanged for cash, other in-app items, or any other consideration.
The Reward has no monetary value and cannot be redeemed for money.
The Founder skin and the Streak Freeze Token are tied to the Google account/device that received them and do not carry over automatically to a different account, though we may offer account-linked cloud sync separately, subject to its own terms.
We may, at our discretion, offer additional ways to obtain a Streak Freeze Token (for example, as a repeatable in-app purchase) or additional cosmetic items. Obtaining the Reward through pre-registration does not entitle you to any other current or future promotion.
5. Availability, changes, and end of promotion

Pre-registration rewards are configured once in Google Play Console for the lifetime of the App's pre-registration campaign and, per Google Play's own policies, cannot later be changed or removed by us once set. We reserve the right to end the pre-registration period itself (i.e., stop accepting new pre-registrations) at any time before launch, consistent with Google Play's pre-registration program rules. This will not affect the Reward for anyone who already pre-registered before that point.

We may update these terms from time to time. Material changes will be reflected by updating the "Last updated" date above. Continued use of the App after a change constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.

6. Not sponsored by Google

This promotion uses a feature Google Play makes available to app developers (its pre-registration reward system) but is not sponsored, endorsed, administered by, or associated with Google in any other way. Any questions about this promotion should be directed to us, not to Google.

7. Disclaimer

The Reward is provided "as is." We do not guarantee that pre-registering will result in you receiving the Reward if the eligibility conditions in Section 2 are not met, and we are not responsible for a failure to deliver the Reward caused by factors outside our reasonable control (see Section 3). SamsiPlay is an individual developer, not a company — these terms are offered by that individual in their capacity as the App's publisher.

8. Contact

Questions about this promotion can be sent to: samsi.appcontact@gmail.com

This document is a plain-language summary of the promotional terms for the Pre-Registration Reward specifically. It is not a substitute for, and does not replace, the App's general Privacy Policy or Google Play's own terms, all of which continue to apply.
